<title>USA: Middletown, Conn. won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Middletown, Conn. won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said it won $17.6 million of Middletown, Conn., general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.09 percent.</p>
